                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d73fd8b-7fcc-4e2c-ba56-53f70aa61c26",
                                "sense_id": "0bba6737-8f52-3a6b-b7da-8d1fc7f91e14",
                                "text": "Far aloft, over the Altar of the Fatherland, on their tall crane standards of iron, swing pensile our antique Cassolettes or Pans of Incense; dispensing sweet incense-fumes[.]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7dbbedb-e9a1-31f4-abe0-6c27e0d2a169",
                        "entry_id": "cc952a50-9ff0-322f-95b2-f765b140e853",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The natural scent of a woman."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "efd92849-e71f-448c-8cc9-4e9eb51f2082",
                                "sense_id": "c7dbbedb-e9a1-31f4-abe0-6c27e0d2a169",
                                "text": "“Don't you like the word cassolette, Julian?” He supposed Thayer thought she was being clever. Cassolette was also a reference to the natural fragrance of a woman."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "909297c2-6197-4098-87c4-3d02221409a8",
                                "sense_id": "c7dbbedb-e9a1-31f4-abe0-6c27e0d2a169",
                                "text": "I know you're in a hurry to find out about cassolette, but please first note that “if you use your palm, rub it over your own and your partner's armpit area first.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfc19837-0e6f-43bf-b4b8-96e63357783d",
                                "sense_id": "c7dbbedb-e9a1-31f4-abe0-6c27e0d2a169",
                                "text": "I'm still bemused by the original \"cassolette\", which turns out to be \"the natural perfume of a clean woman: her greatest natural asset after her beauty\", and definitely not to be confused with a small hotpot."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
